%C - GPIO Resource Manager

Usage:
%C [-N path] [-U uid[:gid[,sup_gid]*]]

Options:
-N path                         Specify the location where the GPIO resource manger will attach to.
                                The default path is /dev/gpio
-U uid[:gid[,sup_gid]*] or      Run as the given user (or uid) with the given group ids. Note that if
    -U user_name[,sup_gid]*     the user is specified by name, the given groups are added to that user's
                                group list. If the user is specified by uid and no groups are listed,
                                the process inherits the parent process' group list.
